r in vehicles.\n\nMotorists should not attempt to drive around barricades or drive cars\nthrough flooded areas.\n\nCaution is urged when walking near riverbanks.\n\nAdditional information is available at www.weather.gov/abq.\n\nThe next statement will be issued Thursday afternoon at noon MDT.","response":"Avoid","note":null,"parameters":{"AWIPSidentifier":["FLSABQ"],"WMOidentifier":["WGUS85 KABQ 281745"],"NWSheadline":["FLOOD WARNING REMAINS IN EFFECT UNTIL FURTHER NOTICE"],"BLOCKCHANNEL":["EAS","NWEM","CMAS"],"EAS-ORG":["WXR"],"VTEC":["/O.CON.KABQ.FL.W.0012.000000T0000Z-000000T0000Z/"],"expiredReferences":["w-nws.webmaster@noaa.gov,urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.cfa50f6a669504223baea6cf773706c7874c5ef7.001.1,2026-10-26T22:39:00-06:00 w-nws.webmaster@noaa.gov,urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.39e8506ed8dbae3b2ee3c1ce6cefcc6409afa700.001.1,2026-10-26T11:52:00-06:00 w-nws.webmaster@noaa.gov,urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.a95afcfe227f584256cb76078581dda79ebfad8f.001.1,2026-10-26T09:20:00-06:00 w-nws.webmaster@noaa.gov,urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.465e5eee238988cc5c188140de5744b5af99b4fb.001.1,2026-10-26T19:10:00-06:00 w-nws.webmaster@noaa.gov,urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.f08c91f0acee371977de089c46578f9af9ef253f.001.1,2026-10-25T19:24:00-06:00 w-nws.webmaster@noaa.gov,urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.6809157c7625c7c8299a6b0b582e7722812a02eb.001.1,2026-10-25T08:26:00-06:00 w-nws.webmaster@noaa.gov,urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.b81892c86e6f2364cd456f42102fe2e384f4dd10.001.1,2026-10-25T13:20:00-06:00 w-nws.webmaster@noaa.gov,urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.f370ba9d84402b34472bc17123a2c52af14dfdf3.001.1,2026-10-25T07:54:00-06:00 w-nws.webmaster@noaa.gov,urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.55a0d1a6b5d267545b412f4507f6bd6d355c2d14.001.1,2026-10-24T19:41:00-06:00 w-nws.webmaster@noaa.gov,urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.46539f06bc13faf3d205e10c0b0931861afdcc31.001.1,2026-10-24T08:39:00-06:00 w-nws.webmaster@noaa.gov,urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.fd0cb1ab4ded031e4075f26eccb250692880c1a1.001.1,2026-10-23T13:33:00-06:00 w-nws.webmaster@noaa.gov,urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.d21f5